  "step_3": "The information relevant to the decision reason (the sure outcome, deviations, and weighted differences) is not considered in the verbal report. The individual only evaluates the probability of loss, not the magnitude of the loss or the weighted sum of deviations. The decision reason requires consideration of the sure outcome (which is 0 in both cases) and the differences from it, weighted by probabilities. The individual's justification is based solely on the probability of loss (i.e., lower probability of loss is better), which is not equivalent to the rule described in the decision reason. Therefore, the individual did not use the decision reason. The report shows a different reasoning process (risk probability minimization), not the one involving sure outcomes and weighted differences. Thus, the decision reason was not used.",
